# EN: THE FEDERAL PACT, second redesign (22/9/2026 night, decided with Juan; the vic3-journals skill).
#     A journal to follow Argentina's own politics: the map of the thirteen on top, the count on a band
#     below it, and -- after the daimyos of ep2's Meiji Restoration journal -- the list of the THIRTEEN
#     (all of them since the third pass, 22/9/2026 night), each with who governs it and its state, and
#     the grievances by section. No header picture and nothing about Oribe: the remittance to him is handled by
#     events (gg_international.10/.11). Table: docs/guerra-grande-flujo/pacto-textos-mecanica.md.
# ES: EL PACTO FEDERAL, segundo rediseño. Un journal para seguir la interna argentina: arriba el mapa de
#     las trece, la cuenta en una franja debajo y, como los daimyos del journal Meiji de ep2, la lista de
#     las TRECE (desde la tercera pasada), con quien gobierna y su estado, y los agravios por seccion. Sin cabecera y
#     sin Oribe: la remesa va por eventos.
flowcontainer = {
	name = "gg_pact_overview"
	direction = vertical
	parentanchor = hcenter
	spacing = 10
	ignoreinvisible = yes
	widget = {
		size = { 520 440 }
		parentanchor = hcenter
		background = { using = dark_area }
		icon = { position = { 115 12 } size = { 290 416 } texture = "gfx/interface/gg_situations/pact_jujuy.dds" color = { 0.56 0.70 0.66 1 } visible = "[EqualTo_CFixedPoint(JournalEntry.MakeScope.ScriptValue('gg_ui_pact_jujuy'), '(CFixedPoint)0')]" }
